<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia 1996/97 wheat forecast 23.40 mln T.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia 1996/97 wheat forecast 23.40 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian wheat production for 1996/97 (July-June) has been revised up to 23.497 million tonnes from 23.116 million, the Australian Bureau of Agricutural and Resource Economics (ABARE) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The increase is based on a late tally of crop sizes, ABARE analyst Vince O'Donnell said.</p>
<p>&quot;We've added up some late crops and other bits and pirces, which increased our estimate,&quot; O'Donnell told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
